IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-acts-after-2017`

-- Tests of sgta-i-acts-after-2017.l4.  Every expected value is read from the Act's own "First published" line, the Legislative History's Commencement line (TA1999.txt:7192-7302) or the amending provision, as quoted in the module, not from the L4.

§ `The days: first published, and effective`
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 26 of 2018` EQUALS Date 20 4 2018
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 15 of 2019` EQUALS Date 4 6 2019
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 40 of 2018` EQUALS Date 7 11 2018
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 4 of 2021` EQUALS Date 18 2 2021
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 25 of 2021` EQUALS Date 11 10 2021
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 12 of 2020` EQUALS Date 11 5 2020
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 13 of 2026` EQUALS Date 5 6 2026
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 26 of 2018` EQUALS Date 16 5 2018
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 15 of 2019` EQUALS Date 1 1 2020
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 40 of 2018` EQUALS Date 30 7 2020
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 4 of 2021` EQUALS Date 1 3 2021
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 25 of 2021` EQUALS Date 1 4 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 12 of 2020` EQUALS Date 1 10 2025
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 13 of 2026` EQUALS Date 2 10 2026

§ `The sections each amends, and which of them is on the decisive chain`
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the edition whose section numbers it uses` `Act 13 of 2026` EQUALS "2020 Ed."
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the edition whose section numbers it uses` `Act 25 of 2021` EQUALS "2000 Ed."
