#ASSERT elem "32J" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 40 of 2018`)
#ASSERT elem "2" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 4 of 2021`)
#ASSERT elem "2" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 12 of 2020`)
#ASSERT elem "33" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 25 of 2021`)
#ASSERT elem "92" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 13 of 2026`)
#ASSERT NOT (elem "53" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 13 of 2026`))
#ASSERT count (`Act 25 of 2021: the sections of the Telecommunications Act it amends (in the 2000 Ed. numbers)`) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT count (`Act 13 of 2026: what it changes in the Telecommunications Act (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`) EQUALS 12
-- Only Act 25 of 2021 touches a section on the chain (s 33(7) of the 2000 Edition, now s 53(7)).
#ASSERT elem "33" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 25 of 2021`)
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 25 of 2021`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 26 of 2018`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 15 of 2019`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 40 of 2018`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 4 of 2021`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 12 of 2020`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 13 of 2026`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT elem "33" (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` "2000 Ed.")
#ASSERT NOT (elem "33" (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` "2020 Ed."))
#ASSERT elem "53" (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` "2020 Ed.")
#ASSERT count (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` "2000 Ed.") EQUALS 8
#ASSERT count (`The decisive chain of the Telecommunications Act, as section numbers of the edition` "1970 Ed.") EQUALS 0

§ `Which amendments are in operation for a conduct day, as read on a reading day`
-- The amendment is in operation when its effective day is on or before the conduct day AND on or before the reading day (the published day is assumed to be the effective day).
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 25 of 2021` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 1 4 2022)
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 25 of 2021` (Date 31 3 2022) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 25 of 2021` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 31 3 2022))
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 13 of 2026` (Date 2 10 2026) (Date 4 11 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 13 of 2026` (Date 1 10 2026) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT elem `Act 26 of 2018` (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2020) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT elem `Act 15 of 2019` (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2020) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (elem `Act 40 of 2018` (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2020) (Date 4 11 2026)))
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 15 5 2018) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 5 2018) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 12 2021) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2025) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 8
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 4 11 2026) (Date 4 11 2026)) EQUALS 9
#ASSERT count (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 4 11 2026) (Date 1 1 2020)) EQUALS 2

§ `The one amended provision on the chain: the word in s 33(7), now s 53(7)`
-- The 2000 Edition prints "without leave of the court"; the 2026 consolidation prints "without permission of the court"; Act 25 of 2021 s 212(b) substitutes the word from 1 April 2022.
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 29 12 2000) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 12 2000) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST "leave"
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 3 2022) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST "leave"
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST "permission"
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 31 3 2022) EQUALS JUST "leave"
#ASSERT `TA s 33(7), now s 53(7): the word before "of the court" in the notice-of-defence subsection, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 4 2022) (Date 1 4 2022) EQUALS JUST "permission"

§ `The two s 2 definitions the other Acts change`
#ASSERT `TA s 2, definition of "owner": paragraph (b) still names HUDC housing estates, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 28 2 2021) (Date 4 11 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA s 2, definition of "owner": paragraph (b) still names HUDC housing estates, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 3 2021) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT `TA s 2, definition of "owner": paragraph (b) still names HUDC housing estates, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 3 2021) (Date 28 2 2021)
#ASSERT `TA s 2, definitions of "common property" and "owner" (paragraph (a)(iii)): the name of the strata statute, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 9 2025) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS "Building Maintenance and Strata Management Act"
#ASSERT `TA s 2, definitions of "common property" and "owner" (paragraph (a)(iii)): the name of the strata statute, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2025) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS "Building (Strata Management) Act"
