§ `Act 31 of 2022 (with S 850/2022) and G.N. No. S 26/2022 (Part 3, 2026-11-04)`
-- Act 31 of 2022: first published 28 Oct 2022; its commencement notification S 850/2022 was first published 31 Oct 2022 and brings the Act (except ss 4(1)(a) to (d) and (f), 10, 12(2) to (6), 16(b), 20(2) and 22(3), none of which is s 21) into operation on 1 Nov 2022.
-- S 26/2022: first published 12 Jan 2022 at 7 pm; paragraph 1(1): in operation 13 Jan 2022 except paragraph 12 (30 Jun 2022), and paragraph 22 amends the Telecommunications Act.
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `Act 31 of 2022` EQUALS Date 28 10 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `Act 31 of 2022` EQUALS Date 1 11 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day a reader could see its date of effect` `Act 31 of 2022` EQUALS Date 31 10 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day it was first published in the Gazette` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` EQUALS Date 12 1 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day its amendment took effect` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` EQUALS Date 13 1 2022
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the day a reader could see its date of effect` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` EQUALS Date 12 1 2022
