#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the edition whose section numbers it uses` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` EQUALS "2020 Ed."
#ASSERT elem "46" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `Act 31 of 2022`)
#ASSERT elem "40" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `G.N. No. S 26/2022`)
#ASSERT elem "41" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `G.N. No. S 26/2022`)
#ASSERT elem "2" (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the sections it amends, in its own numbers` `G.N. No. S 26/2022`)
#ASSERT count (`Act 31 of 2022: what it changes in the Telecommunications Act (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT count (`G.N. No. S 26/2022: what it changes in the Telecommunications Act (in the 2020 Ed. numbers)`) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `Act 31 of 2022`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT count (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amended sections that are on the decisive chain (s 2 excluded)` `G.N. No. S 26/2022`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 31 of 2022` (Date 1 11 2022) (Date 31 10 2022)
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 31 of 2022` (Date 1 11 2022) (Date 30 10 2022))
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `Act 31 of 2022` (Date 31 10 2022) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT `Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` (Date 13 1 2022) (Date 12 1 2022)
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` (Date 13 1 2022) (Date 11 1 2022))
#ASSERT NOT (`Instrument amending the Telecommunications Act after Act 15 of 2017: the amendment is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` `G.N. No. S 26/2022` (Date 12 1 2022) (Date 4 11 2026))
-- Act 25 of 2021 (1 Apr 2022): the day a reader could see it is assumed to be the effective day, so a reader on 31 Mar 2022 does not see it, unchanged from before.
#ASSERT elem `Act 31 of 2022` (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 11 2022) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (elem `Act 31 of 2022` (`Instruments after Act 15 of 2017 whose amendments of the Telecommunications Act are in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 10 2022) (Date 4 11 2026)))
